@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState : Start

InitialState --> CheckContentAvailability
CheckContentAvailability : Check if latest content is available

CheckContentAvailability --> ContentAvailable : Content is available
CheckContentAvailability --> ContentNotAvailable : Content is not available

ContentAvailable --> DisplayLatestContent
DisplayLatestContent : Display latest content to user

ContentNotAvailable --> ShowNotAvailableMessage
ShowNotAvailableMessage : Show message that content is not available

DisplayLatestContent --> [*] : End
ShowNotAvailableMessage --> [*] : End
@enduml
